&INFO
   Input generated by cellify
   BOMD restart + Wannier calculation
&END

&CPMD
   MOLECULAR DYNAMICS BO
   MIRROR
   RESTART WAVEFUNCTION COORDINATES VELOCITIES LATEST
   TRAJECTORY XYZ FORCES SAMPLE
         1
   FILEPATH
         ./tmp
   NOSE IONS MASSIVE
         300.0D0 500
   MAXSTEP
         10000
   TIMESTEP
         40.0
   PRINT FORCES ON
   VDW CORRECTION ON

   DIPOLE DYNAMICS WANNIER SAMPLE
         1
   WANNIER OPTIMIZATION JACOBI
   WANNIER PARAMETER
         0.1 1e-7 0.0 2000
&END

&SYSTEM
   SYMMETRY
         1
   ANGSTROM
   CELL
         10.0 1.0 1.0 0.0 0.0 0.0
   CUTOFF
         100.0
&END

&DFT
   FUNCTIONAL BLYP
&END

&VDW
   EMPIRICAL CORRECTION
   VDW PARAMETERS
   ALL DFT-D2
   END EMPIRICAL CORRECTION
&END

&ATOMS
